s immutable.\n    - Confirm illegal transitions rejected.\n    - Confirm manual edits outside protected regions do not corrupt canonical store.\n\n  7_test_coverage_quality:\n    - Ensure tests cover:\n        * Transition validation\n        * Terminal immutability\n        * Concurrency\n        * Parse failure artifacting\n        * Recovery path\n    - Verify absence of silent catch-all exception handlers.\n\nevidence_standard:\n  - Cite functions responsible for:\n      * failure logging\n      * lock acquisition\n      * transition validation\n      * dedupe logic\n  - Distinguish confirmed vs inferred behavior.\n  - Treat test pass as supportive but not sufficient.\n\nrequired_output:\n  - Compliance matrix (Spec vs Implementation).\n  - Any remaining structural gaps.\n  - Drift or future fragility risks.\n  - Confidence rating: High / Medium / Low.\n  - Final verdict: DRA-hard compliant / DRA-adequate / Non-compliant.\n\nconstraints:\n  - No reliance on implementation claims without inspection.\n  - No new feature recommendations.\n  - Strict structural verification only.",
