paths.\"\n\nconstraints:\n  - Do not alter canonical file when blocked.\n  - Do not create duplicate failure artifacts.\n  - Preserve idempotence guarantees.\n  - Keep state authority in communicate_scan.py.\n\nacceptance_criteria:\n  - Repro:\n      1) Corrupt communicate.json to trigger SYSTEM_BLOCKED\n      2) Clear INPUT PAD\n      3) Run make communicate\n    Expected:\n      - Reports SYSTEM_BLOCKED (not \u201cNothing to do\u201d)\n      - Refuses execution\n      - Exit non-zero\n      - No state mutation\n  - Tests pass and include the above cases.\n\ndeliverables_requested_from_codex:\n  - Patch to communicate_scan.py implementing preflight check.\n  - Orchestrator alignment patch (if needed).\n  - New/updated unit tests.\n  - Docs update.\n  - Evidence: commands run + tests run + results.",
