ibe/docs/archive/ if size grows,\n      but preserve:\n        - the final verification REQ block\n        - any REQ blocks defining protocol and failure handling\n    - If archiving, maintain stable links/pointers in COMPLIANCE_DRA_HARD.md.\n\nconstraints:\n  - No structural changes to runtime behavior.\n  - Preserve audit trail integrity.\n  - Do not delete failure_log.json or tests.\n  - Keep record portable across repos (relative paths only).\n\nacceptance_criteria:\n  - COMPLIANCE_DRA_HARD.md exists and is self-sufficient for an auditor to:\n      * understand what was verified\n      * find evidence in-tree\n      * reproduce critical checks\n  - Minimal artifact list is explicit and accurate.",
