      "request_text": "problem_type: descriptive\n\nobjective: >\n  Perform an independent meta-validation of the latest \u201cDRA-hard compliant\u201d\n  claim after REQ-20260212-212001, ensuring no structural blind spots remain\n  before declaring the runtime transplant-stable.\n\nmeta_validation_scope:\n  - commscribe/communicate.json\n  - commscribe/communicate.md\n  - commscribe/failure_log.json\n  - commscribe/scripts/communicate_scan.py\n  - commscribe/scripts/runtime_io.py\n  - commscribe/scripts/communicate_orchestrator.py\n  - commscribe/scripts/start_communicate_ui.py\n  - commscribe/tests/\n  - commscribe/docs/COMPLIANCE_DRA_HARD.md\n\nvalidation_requirements:\n\n  1_compliance_record_integrity:\n    - Confirm REQ-20260212-212001 exists in both JSON and MD.\n    - Confirm status is DONE and immutable.\n    - Confirm compliance matrix includes:\n        * state authority validation\n        * failure-source recovery validation\n        * lock/atomic contract validation\n        * UI race resolution validation\n        * idempotence validation\n    - Confirm evidence pointers are valid and not stale.\n\n  2_invariant_recheck:\n    - Re-verify:\n        * Monotonic state transitions\n        * Terminal immutability\n        * SYSTEM_BLOCKED surfacing on all entrypaths\n        * Source-aware failure dedupe\n        * No JSON mutation during recovery validation\n    - Confirm no hidden side-effects introduced by runtime_io abstraction.\n\n  3_cross_project_portability_check:\n    - Confirm no absolute paths.\n    - Confirm no environment-specific assumptions.\n    - Confirm locking mechanism is platform-agnostic.\n    - Confirm no reliance on pre-existing repo structure.\n\n  4_reproducibility_probe:\n    - Re-run:\n        * Healthy empty-input no-op\n        * Markdown-only corruption + recovery\n        * JSON-only corruption + recovery\n        * UI concurrent write scenario\n    - Confirm deterministic outcomes match compliance record.\n\n  5_drift_detection:\n    - Confirm no new global mutable state.\n    - Confirm no silent auto-repair logic.\n    - Confirm no bypass of scanner authority via UI.\n    - Confirm compliance doc matches actual implementation.\n\nrequired_output:\n  - Meta-compliance summary (Pass/Fail per invariant group).\n  - Any residual architectural fragility (if present).\n  - Final portability classification:\n      * Transplant-ready\n      * Transplant-ready with cautions\n      * Not transplant-ready\n  - Confidence rating (High / Medium / Low).\n\nconstraints:\n  - No new feature proposals.\n  - No architectural redesign.\n  - Strict validation only.\n\nsuccess_condition:\n  Runtime can be copied into a fresh repository and,\n  without modification, reproduce all invariant guarantees\n  and compliance proofs deterministically.",
