      "outputs": "Updated the communicate UI layout/styling for INPUT PAD alignment and cleaner visual treatment without changing runtime behavior.\n\nChanges made\n- Added global `box-sizing: border-box` to eliminate width overflow mismatch and keep textarea constrained to container column.\n- Introduced a dedicated `.input-section` wrapper with subtle tint, soft border accent, and light inset shadow so INPUT PAD is visually distinct but not overpowering.\n- Removed inline heading style and replaced with reusable `.section-title` class.\n- Kept textarea at `width: 100%` within container, preserving responsive behavior on desktop/tablet/narrow viewport.\n- Maintained clean vertical spacing and alignment between textarea, label context, and submit button.\n- Preserved all existing JS functionality and deep-link/detail behavior.\n\nValidation outcomes\n- No layout-shift-sensitive logic changed (JS unchanged).\n- No overflow-inducing width calculations remain in INPUT PAD area.\n- REQ detail view and routing functionality unaffected.\n- No runtime behavior changes.",
