      "request_text": "problem_type: prescriptive\n\nobjective: >\n  Execute Cleanup Slice 1 \u2014 Root-Level Status/Audit Entry-Point Consolidation \u2014\n  in a safe, reversible, non-destructive manner that reduces root clutter\n  while preserving all historical artifacts.\n\ncommunicate_request_block_text: |\n  ## REQ: Execute Slice 1 \u2014 Root-Level Status/Audit Entry-Point Consolidation\n\n  ### Objective\n  Consolidate root-level status/audit documents into a single authoritative\n  entry point without deleting or altering historical content.\n\n  This request executes only Slice 1 as previously proposed.\n  No other cleanup slices are in scope.\n\n  ### Target Files (Root-Level)\n  - HANDOFF.md\n  - LATEST_UPDATE.md\n  - PHASE_D_VERIFICATION.md\n  - SESSION_HANDOFF_2026-02-13.md\n  - TECHNICAL_AUDIT.md\n\n  ### Execution Plan (Non-Destructive)\n\n  1. Create a canonical entry file at root:\n       PROJECT_STATUS.md\n\n  2. PROJECT_STATUS.md must:\n       - Briefly describe current project status.\n       - Provide clearly labeled links to:\n           * Current authoritative status document\n           * Latest technical audit\n           * Most recent session handoff\n           * Phase verification docs\n       - Include a \"Historical Status Documents\" section\n         linking to archived items.\n\n  3. Create an archive directory:\n       development_docs/archive/root_status/\n\n  4. Move the five root-level documents into that archive directory\n     WITHOUT modifying their content.\n\n  5. Leave PROJECT_STATUS.md as the only root-level status pointer.\n\n  ### Constraints\n  - Do NOT delete any content.\n  - Do NOT modify document bodies.\n  - Preserve git history.\n  - Do NOT change runtime code.\n  - Do NOT alter CI configuration.\n  - Do NOT touch commscribe runtime files.\n\n  ### Rollback Plan\n  - Restore moved files to root from VCS.\n  - Delete PROJECT_STATUS.md.\n  - No content was modified, so rollback is file-location only.\n\n  ### Verification Steps\n  - Confirm only one new root-level status file exists (PROJECT_STATUS.md).\n  - Confirm archived documents exist intact under:\n        development_docs/archive/root_status/\n  - Confirm no runtime or test files changed.\n  - Confirm test suite still passes.\n\n  ### Expected Outcome\n  - Reduced root-level document clutter.\n  - Clear single entry point for status.\n  - Preserved full historical traceability.\n  - No behavioral or runtime impact.\n\n  ### Risk Classification\n  - Low\n\nformat_notes:\n  - Paste the block above into INPUT PAD.\n  - Run `communicate` to execute.",
