      "execution_log": "- 2026-02-13T05:26:45+00:00 Started Slice 1 execution: preparing archive path and canonical PROJECT_STATUS entry-point document.\n- 2026-02-13T05:27:19+00:00 Completed non-destructive Slice 1 move/consolidation, verified archived files and root pointer, and confirmed commscribe test suite passes (20/20).",
      "outputs": "Executed Slice 1 \u2014 Root-Level Status/Audit Entry-Point Consolidation \u2014 in a non-destructive, reversible manner.\n\nActions performed\n1) Created canonical root entry file:\n- `PROJECT_STATUS.md`\n\n2) Created archive directory:\n- `development_docs/archive/root_status/`\n\n3) Moved the five target root files into archive without editing their bodies:\n- `HANDOFF.md` -> `development_docs/archive/root_status/HANDOFF.md`\n- `LATEST_UPDATE.md` -> `development_docs/archive/root_status/LATEST_UPDATE.md`\n- `PHASE_D_VERIFICATION.md` -> `development_docs/archive/root_status/PHASE_D_VERIFICATION.md`\n- `SESSION_HANDOFF_2026-02-13.md` -> `development_docs/archive/root_status/SESSION_HANDOFF_2026-02-13.md`\n- `TECHNICAL_AUDIT.md` -> `development_docs/archive/root_status/TECHNICAL_AUDIT.md`\n\n4) Left `PROJECT_STATUS.md` as the root-level status pointer.\n\nVerification outcomes\n- `PROJECT_STATUS.md` exists at root.\n- Archived documents exist under `development_docs/archive/root_status/`.\n- Runtime/CI code was not modified by this slice.\n- Commscribe test suite remains passing.\n\nRollback (file-location only)\n- Move archived files back to root from VCS history or reverse-move.\n- Delete `PROJECT_STATUS.md`.",
