Ds in UI list.\n    - Confirmation TOC matches ordering.\n    - Test suite still passing.\n\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n  Constraints\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  - No lifecycle logic changes.\n  - No canonical JSON mutation.\n  - No changes to locking or state authority.\n  - No styling changes in this request.\n  - Maintain DRA-hard guarantees.\n\ndeliverable:\n  - Implementation complete.\n  - Verification evidence included.\n  - Explicit PASS confirmation.",
