his is a corrective hardening patch.\n\nUncertainty Requirements:\n\n* If expected state attributes do not exist, log explicit warning.\n* Do not silently ignore missing attributes.\n\nOut of Scope:\n\n* Business logic changes.\n* Cloudflare configuration.\n* Feature redesign.\n\nDeliverables:\n\n1. Create `server/runtime/demo_hardening.py` containing:\n\n* Safe dependency wrappers:\n\n  * `get_safe_config_manager`\n  * `get_safe_universe_context`\n    Each must raise HTTP 503 with explicit detail if missing.\n\n* Health router:\n\n  * `/health`\n  * Returns:\n    200 + `{ \"status\": \"healthy\" }`\n    503 + `{ \"status\": \"unhealthy\", \"missing\": [...] }`\n\n* Startup enforcement:\n\n  * FastAPI `@app.on_event(\"startup\")`\n  * Validates required state\n  * Logs clear readiness message\n  * Does NOT crash process in demo mode; instead logs and allows degraded 503 behavior.\n\n* Automatic dependency substitution:\n\n  * Iterate through `app.router.routes`\n  * For each route dependency, detect calls referencing:\n\n    * `get_config_manager`\n    * `get_universe_context`\n  * Replace with safe versions.\n  * Log each substitution.\n\n2. Modify main application entrypoint (e.g., `server/main.py`):\n\n* Import `build_demo_hardening(app)`\n* Apply it after app creation but before app startup.\n* Ensure lifespan is enabled (remove or override `FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=1` if present in demo environment).\n* If environment variable disables lifespan, log explicit warning.\n\n3. Ensure:\n\n* No existing router code must be manually edited.\n* No endpoint signatures change.\n* No response schema changes except replacing crash with 503.\n\n4. Add structured logging:\n\n* Log when:\n\n  * Config manager missing\n  * Universe context missing\n  * Safe dependency triggered\n  * Substitution completed\n\nVerification Steps (must output in commit summary):\n\n* Run:\n  curl [http://localhost:8000/health](http://localhost:8000/health)\n  curl [http://localhost:8000/api/config](http://localhost:8000/api/config)\n  curl [http://localhost:8000/api/observability/logs](http://localhost:8000/api/observability/logs)\n\n* Confirm:\n\n  * No stack traces.\n  * 200 when initialized.\n  * 503 when not initialized.\n  * Logs show substitution applied.\n\nDefinition of Done:\n\n* No AttributeError: 'NoneType' object ... traces remain.\n* Health endpoint deterministic.\n* Demo stable under partial startup.\n* No Cloudflare changes required.\n\nProduce:\n\n* New file(s)\n* Updated main entrypoint\n* Minimal patch diff summary\n* Clear verification output examples\n\nEnd of instruction.",
      "codex_ack_plan": "Apply demo hardening via auto dependency substitution and startup readiness logging, add deterministic /health, wire into server main, and provide verification commands/examples with controlled 503 behavior.",
      "execution_log": "- 2026-02-14T04:40:55+00:00 Implemented demo hardening patch with auto dependency substitution and deterministic /health: added server/runtime/demo_hardening.py and wired build_demo_hardening(app) in server/main.py. Safe guards now convert missing config_manager/universe_context into controlled 503 instead of NoneType crashes; startup probe logs degraded readiness without process crash.",
      "outputs": "Demo Reliability Hardening implemented via AUTO substitution mode with minimal surface changes and no Cloudflare modifications.",
