.g., empty logs), handle them with controlled 503 or appropriate response.\n\nMinimal patch diff summary:\n\nBefore/after changes noted.\n\nVerification steps:\n\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/observability/logs\n\n\nExpect:\n\n200 with logs if initialized.\n\n503 with structured detail if not initialized.\n\nNo internal server error.\n\nDefinition of Done:\n\nObservability logs endpoint no longer crashes with 500.\n\nBehaves consistently with other guarded endpoints.",
