\n\n\n\u2192 200 {\"status\":\"healthy\"}\n\nOptional:\n\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/config\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/observability/logs\n\n\n\u2192 200\n\nDefinition of Done:\n\nOrigin returns healthy on /health with full state.\n\nNo degraded 503 due to missing state.\n\nEnd.\n\nRationale from FastAPI docs: FastAPI\u2019s normal lifecycle events (startup handlers or a lifespan context) run initialization code before the app handles requests. This patch ensures they execute instead of being bypassed by FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=1",
      "codex_ack_plan": "Patch startup mode selection so demo runs full FastAPI lifespan initialization (config_manager/universe_context present before traffic), keep non-demo behavior compatible, and update demo env/docs guidance. Validate via static checks and health endpoint verification commands.",
