      "outputs": "Trace findings: config_manager and universe_context are initialized in AppState.set_universe() during server.lifespan.lifespan(); they remain None when noop lifespan path is active.",
      "evidence": "Exact construction/attachment sites:\n1) universe_context creation\n- file: server/state.py:43\n- function: AppState.set_universe\n- statement: self.universe_context = UniverseContext(universe)\n\n2) config_manager creation\n- file: server/state.py:45\n- function: AppState.set_universe\n- statement: self.config_manager = ConfigManager(universe=universe)\n\n3) startup path that triggers both\n- file: server/lifespan.py:23-41\n- function: lifespan(app)\n- calls: state = get_state(); state.set_universe(universe); state.config_manager.load()\n\nCall hierarchy (serve.py -> app -> startup):\n- scripts/serve.py:76-83 calls uvicorn.run('server:app', ...)\n- importing server module resolves app object from server/main.py\n- server/main.py:31-38 constructs FastAPI with lifespan=noop_lifespan if USE_NOOP_LIFESPAN else full_lifespan\n- if full_lifespan selected, server/lifespan.py lifespan() runs before serving requests and initializes config_manager/universe_context\n- if noop_lifespan selected, initialization logic is skipped and both remain None on AppState singleton\n\nFlag conditions affecting this path:\n- scripts/serve.py:73-74: --no-lifespan sets FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=1\n- server/main.py:22 computes USE_NOOP_LIFESPAN from FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN\n- server/main.py:17-20 demo override: if MARKET_WATCH_DEMO_MODE is true and FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=1, it forces FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=0 before app creation\n\nWhy demo runs could still be uninitialized:\n- If server started with noop lifespan (FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=1) without effective demo override at import time, lifespan init is bypassed and AppState fields remain None.\n\nMinimal suggestion to ensure demo startup initializes state:\n- Run with MARKET_WATCH_DEMO_MODE=true and FASTAPI_DISABLE_LIFESPAN=0 (or avoid --no-lifespan) so server/main.py selects full_lifespan and server/lifespan.py executes state.set_universe(...).",
