      "outputs": "HEAD_SNIPPET (`static/index.html:3-13`, `static/index.html:900-915`)\n```html\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Market Watch Trading Bot</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/img/favicon.png?v=1.0.0\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        // Cache-busting token for static assets\n        const ASSET_VERSION = 'v1.0.1';\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        /* ...inline CSS (layout + responsive rules) ... */\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .tooltip .tooltip-text { width: 220px; }\n            .modal { min-width: 90vw; }\n        }\n    </style>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n    <link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n</head>\n```\n\nLAYOUT_HTML_SNIPPET (`static/index.html:915-979`, `static/index.html:1210-1213`)\n```html\n</head><body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\">\n                <h1>Market Watch Trading Bot</h1>\n                <span class=\"tooltip tooltip-topbar\">...</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;\">...</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <div class=\"ticker\">\n            <div class=\"ticker-label\">Top % Gainers</div>\n            <div class=\"ticker-viewport\">\n                <div class=\"ticker-track\" id=\"top-gainers-ticker\">...</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ticker\">\n            <div class=\"ticker-label\">Market Indices</div>\n            <div class=\"ticker-viewport\">\n                <div class=\"ticker-track\" id=\"market-indices-ticker\">...</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n            <div class=\"card-header\"><h2>Agents</h2>...</div>\n            <div class=\"agent-grid\" id=\"agents-grid\">...</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card full card-full-gap\">...</div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"card\">...\n```\n\nSTYLE_SNIPPET (`static/index.html:25-60`, `static/index.html:113-118`, `static/index.html:167-172`, `static/index.html:201-205`, `static/index.html:542-546`, `static/index.html:751-755`, `static/index.html:800-803`, `static/index.html:844`, `static/index.html:907-911`)\n```css\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nbody {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    padding: 20px;\n}\n.container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.analytics-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n}\n.returns-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n}\n.trade-history-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n.agent-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n.obs-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n.ticker-viewport { flex: 1; }\n\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .analytics-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .tooltip .tooltip-text { width: 220px; }\n    .modal { min-width: 90vw; }\n}\n```",
