idation).\n\nUntracked files\n- .demo/cloudflare-demo.env: Local demo tunnel runtime env (contains machine-local values; likely not for VCS).\n- .demo/cloudflared.pid: Local process PID artifact (runtime only; do not commit).\n- .dockerignore: Docker build-context ignore list mirroring repo hygiene exclusions.\n- .env.demo: Local demo env instance (contains secrets placeholders/values; usually do not commit).\n- .env.demo.example: Demo env template with paper/demo defaults and lifespan flags.\n- Dockerfile: Container image definition launching `uvicorn` with `--port ${PORT:-8000}`.\n- PROJECT_STATUS.md: New canonical root-level status pointer to archived status docs.\n- RECENT_CHANGES_SUMMARY.md: Narrative summary of recent REQs and structural changes.\n- STRATEGIC_ROADMAP_NEXT_PHASE.md: Strategic assessment and staged plan documentation.\n- commscribe/CODEX_COMMUNICATE_INSTRUCTIONS.md: Operator contract for `communicate` workflow.\n- commscribe/README.md: Full runtime contract, lifecycle, and invariants documentation.\n- commscribe/communicate.json: Canonical commscribe request/state store snapshot.\n- commscribe/communicate.md: Human-readable queue/transcript snapshot (very large runtime artifact).\n- commscribe/docs/COMPLIANCE_DRA_HARD.md: Compliance record and post-transplant remediation notes.\n- commscribe/docs/DROP_IN_INSTALL.md: Installation manifest for transplanting commscribe runtime.\n- commscribe/scripts/communicate_orchestrator.py: Thin orchestrator wrapper over scanner transitions.\n- commscribe/scripts/communicate_scan.py: Core state authority scanner (lock, transitions, recovery).\n- commscribe/scripts/runtime_io.py: Shared lock + atomic write primitives.\n- commscribe/scripts/start_communicate_ui.py: Local UI server writing input via scanner API.\n- commscribe/tests/test_communicate_scan.py: Scanner lifecycle/recovery regression tests.\n- commscribe/tests/test_communicate_ui.py: UI/scanner integration and concurrency tests.\n- commscribe/ui/index.html: Communicate web UI page.\n- commscribe/ui/market-watch-theme.css: Optional market-watch themed stylesheet.\n- commscribe/ui/theme.css: Default communicate UI theme stylesheet.\n- docs/FLY_IO_DEPLOY.md: Fly.io deployment runbook and verification steps.\n- docs/demo/STAKEHOLDER_DEMO.md: Temporary Cloudflare tunnel demo runbook.\n- err.txt: Incident report with findings/path-forward narrative and embedded error evidence.\n- fly.toml: Fly.io app/service config referencing Dockerfile and internal port.\n- output.md: Captured terminal output / log excerpts (analysis artifact).\n- reports/inventory/USAGE_README.md: How to serve/use the inventory report via local HTTP.\n- reports/inventory/data.json: Generated repository inventory dataset.\n- reports/inventory/generate_inventory_report.py: Generator for structural inventory JSON+HTML.\n- reports/inventory/index.html: Interactive inventory report frontend.\n- scripts/demo/cloudflare_demo.env.example: Template for cloudflare demo tunnel env.\n- scripts/demo/deploy_cloudflare_demo.sh: Starts temporary Cloudflare tunnel with validations.\n- scripts/demo/disable_cloudflare_demo.sh: Stops tunnel and cleans URL/PID artifacts.\n- scripts/demo/setup_cloudflare_demo.sh: Bootstraps `.demo` and `.env.demo` templates.\n- scripts/demo/verify_cloudflare_demo.sh: Verifies tunnel/home/health endpoints.\n- server/runtime/__init__.py: Runtime hardening package marker.\n- server/runtime/demo_hardening.py: Safe dependency wrappers and demo health hardening paths.\n\nPROPOSED_COMMIT_GROUPS\n\nCOMMIT 1\nType: feat\nMessage: feat(commscribe): add communicate runtime, UI, and verification suite\nFiles:\n- commscribe/CODEX_COMMUNICATE_INSTRUCTIONS.md\n- commscribe/README.md\n- commscribe/docs/COMPLIANCE_DRA_HARD.md\n- commscribe/docs/DROP_IN_INSTALL.md\n- commscribe/scripts/communicate_orchestrator.py\n- commscribe/scripts/communicate_scan.py\n- commscribe/scripts/runtime_io.py\n- commscribe/scripts/start_communicate_ui.py\n- commscribe/tests/test_communicate_scan.py\n- commscribe/tests/test_communicate_ui.py\n- commscribe/ui/index.html\n- commscribe/ui/theme.css\n- commscribe/ui/market-watch-theme.css\nWhy grouped:\n- These are one coherent subsystem: runtime state machine + UI + tests + docs.\n\nCOMMIT 2\nType: feat\nMessage: feat(server): harden demo startup path and observability dependencies\nFiles:\n- server/main.py\n- server/routers/observability.py\n- server/runtime/__init__.py\n- server/runtime/demo_hardening.py\nWhy grouped:\n- Server runtime behavior changes required for demo reliability and null-safe dependencies.\n\nCOMMIT 3\nType: fix\nMessage: fix(ui): stabilize mobile layout and timestamp rendering in dashboard\nFiles:\n- static/index.html\nWhy grouped:\n- Frontend-only behavioral fixes (mobile overflow/stacking and display-time formatting).\n\nCOMMIT 4\nType: refactor\nMessage: refactor(testing): standardize test artifact schema to timestamped run directories\nFiles:\n- agents/dev/test_audit_agent.py\n- scripts/run_tests.sh\n- scripts/run_tests.bat\n- scripts/dev_tools_tui.py\n- scripts/show_test_audit_summary.py\n- scripts/organize_project_files.py\n- tests/README.md\n- README.md\nWhy grouped:\n- Unified test output naming contract across tooling + documentation.\n\nCOMMIT 5\nType: feat\nMessage: feat(deploy): add Fly.io container deployment configuration\nFiles:\n- Dockerfile\n- fly.toml\n- .dockerignore\n- docs/FLY_IO_DEPLOY.md\nWhy grouped:\n- All files define or document one deployment target.\n\nCOMMIT 6\nType: feat\nMessage: feat(demo): add temporary Cloudflare tunnel demo workflow\nFiles:\n- scripts/demo/cloudflare_demo.env.example\n- scripts/demo/setup_cloudflare_demo.sh\n- scripts/demo/deploy_cloudflare_demo.sh\n- scripts/demo/verify_cloudflare_demo.sh\n- scripts/demo/disable_cloudflare_demo.sh\n- docs/demo/STAKEHOLDER_DEMO.md\n- .env.demo.example\nWhy grouped:\n- End-to-end demo tunnel workflow (setup/deploy/verify/teardown + docs/template).\n\nCOMMIT 7\nType: docs\nMessage: do