      "outputs": "Implemented requested metrics instrumentation and release quality artifacts.\n\nFiles modified\n- `server/main.py`\n- `requirements.txt`\n\nFiles added\n- `monitoring/prometheus/prometheus.yml`\n- `monitoring/prometheus/alert_rules.yml`\n- `monitoring/grafana/dashboards/governance_overview.json`\n- `scripts/governance/calc_release_quality.py`\n- `reports/governance/deployments.sample.json`\n- `reports/governance/release_quality.json` (generated sample output)\n- `.github/workflows/release-quality-metrics.yml`\n\n1) FastAPI instrumentation\n- Added Prometheus counters/histogram in `server/main.py`:\n  - `http_requests_total{method,path,status}`\n  - `http_request_errors_total{method,path}`\n  - `http_request_duration_seconds{method,path}`\n- Added HTTP middleware to record request count, 5xx errors, and latency.\n- Exposed `/metrics` endpoint compatible with Prometheus using `prometheus_client`.\n- Added dependency in `requirements.txt`:\n  - `prometheus-client>=0.20.0`\n\n2) Prometheus scrape config\n- `monitoring/prometheus/prometheus.yml` defines scrape target:\n  - job `market_watch_api`\n  - target `127.0.0.1:8000`\n  - `metrics_path: /metrics`\n- `monitoring/prometheus/alert_rules.yml` includes baseline alerts:\n  - High 5xx ratio (`>2% for 10m`)\n  - High p95 latency (`>800ms for 15m`)\n\n3) Grafana dashboard\n- `monitoring/grafana/dashboards/governance_overview.json` includes panels for:\n  - Request volume (RPS)\n  - Error rate (%)\n  - Success rate (%)\n  - p95 latency\n\n4) CI scripts and workflow\n- Added KPI script:\n  - `scripts/governance/calc_release_quality.py`\n  - Computes deployment lead time (p50/p90/mean hours) and change failure rate.\n- Added sample input:\n  - `reports/governance/deployments.sample.json`\n- Added CI workflow template:\n  - `.github/workflows/release-quality-metrics.yml`\n  - Runs nightly + manual (`workflow_dispatch`), computes KPI JSON, uploads artifact.\n\nMinimal diff summary\n- `M requirements.txt`\n- `M server/main.py`\n- `A monitoring/prometheus/prometheus.yml`\n- `A monitoring/prometheus/alert_rules.yml`\n- `A monitoring/grafana/dashboards/governance_overview.json`\n- `A scripts/governance/calc_release_quality.py`\n- `A reports/governance/deployments.sample.json`\n- `A reports/governance/release_quality.json`\n- `A .github/workflows/release-quality-metrics.yml`\n\nVerification commands + expected outputs\n1) App metrics endpoint\n- Command: `curl http://localhost:8000/metrics | head`\n- Expect: Prometheus text exposition with `http_requests_total`, `http_request_duration_seconds`, `http_request_errors_total`.\n\n2) Prometheus target/rules\n- Command: `curl -s http://localhost:9090/api/v1/targets | jq '.data.activeTargets[] | {health,scrapeUrl}'`\n- Expect: target health `\"up\"` for app scrape URL.\n- Command: `curl -s http://localhost:9090/api/v1/rules | jq '.data.groups[].name'`\n- Expect: group containing `market-watch-sli-alerts`.\n\n3) Grafana dashboard\n- Import `monitoring/grafana/dashboards/governance_overview.json`.\n- Expect: panels render query results once Prometheus datasource is configured.\n\n4) KPI script\n- Command:\n  - `python3 scripts/governance/calc_release_quality.py --input reports/governance/deployments.sample.json --out reports/governance/release_quality.json`\n- Expect: JSON output with keys:\n  - `lead_time_hours` (`p50`, `p90`, `mean`)\n  - `change_failure_rate` (`ratio`, `percent`)",
      "evidence": "Validation run:\n- `python3 -m py_compile server/main.py scripts/governance/calc_release_quality.py` (pass)\n- `python3 scripts/governance/calc_release_quality.py --input reports/governance/deployments.sample.json --out reports/governance/release_quality.json` (pass)\n\nObserved sample KPI output:\n- deployments: 2\n- failures: 1\n- lead_time_hours: p50=1.5, p90=3.5, mean=2.5\n- change_failure_rate: 50.0%\n\nNote:\n- Live curl checks for `/metrics` and Prometheus/Grafana require running services in host runtime; commands provided above for direct verification.",
