      "request_id": "REQ-20260214-205645",
      "status": "DONE",
      "author": "USER",
      "created_at": "2026-02-15T02:56:45+00:00",
      "last_updated_at": "2026-02-15T03:23:09+00:00",
      "request_text": "codex> Implement smart refresh control in Communicate UI\n\nProblem Type:\nprescriptive\n\nObjective:\nImprove the Communicate UI refresh behavior by making it conditional and user-friendly. Replace blanket periodic full re-rendering with a smart update loop that:\n- Re-renders only when data changes\n- Preserves scroll position and selection\n- Temporarily pauses refresh during user interactions\n- Adds an optional manual refresh control\n\nMetric / Evaluative Standard:\n- No unnecessary full redraws when data has not changed\n- Scroll and text selection are preserved across updates\n- Refresh is paused while the user is copying or interacting\n- Manual refresh button triggers immediate update\n\nTime Horizon:\nIncremental UI improvement\n\nScope:\n- Frontend Communicate UI code (JavaScript/HTML)\n- Refresh logic usually tied to polling\n- DOM update logic around response panels/request list\n\nConstraints:\nBinding:\n- DO NOT break existing functionality\n- Preserve existing data model and request execution semantics\n\nSoft:\n- Keep UX simple and accessible\n- Avoid large architectural rewrites (no WebSockets unless required)\n\nIgnored:\n- Backend changes\n\nDeliverables:\n\n1) **Smart Polling Logic**\n   - Replace naive `setInterval` full refresh with conditional fetch\n   - Compute hash of latest data\n   - Only re-render when hash changes\n\n2) **User Interaction Pause**\n   - Detect:\n     - text selection in output\n     - active copy action\n     - input focus in text areas\n   - Temporarily suspend auto refresh until interaction ends\n\n3) **Preserve Scroll/Selection**\n   - Before update:\n     - capture scroll position\n     - capture text selection\n   - After update:\n     - restore both if unchanged\n\n4) **Manual Refresh Control**\n   - Add \u201cRefresh Now\u201d button in top navigation\n   - Clicking triggers immediate fetch and render\n\n5) **Minimal Diff Patch**\n   - Show only changed lines in patch\n   - No functionality loss from current behavior\n\n6) **Verification**\n   - Test:\n     - repeated poll fetch without data changes \u2192 no redraw\n     - scroll position maintained after refresh\n     - copy interaction (click/drag) doesn\u2019t get interrupted\n     - manual refresh works\n\nExample commit message:\n\nfeat(ui): smart refresh control \u2014 conditional polling, interaction pause, and manual refresh\n\nEnd.",
      "codex_ack_plan": "Implement smart polling with signature-based conditional render, pause refresh during copy/selection/input focus, preserve scroll/input selection across updates, and add manual Refresh Now control in Communicate UI.",
      "execution_log": "- 2026-02-15T03:15:44+00:00 Applied smart refresh control in commscribe/ui/index.html and validated existing UI unittest suite passes unchanged.",
      "outputs": "Implemented smart refresh control in Communicate UI with minimal frontend-only changes.\n\nFiles modified\n- `commscribe/ui/index.html`\n\nWhat changed\n1) Smart polling (conditional redraw)\n- Added signatures/state tracking:\n  - `lastInputPadValue`\n  - `lastRequestListSig`\n  - `lastDetailSigByReq`\n- `loadInputPad`, `loadRequests`, and `loadDetail` now return change flags.\n- UI re-render happens only when force refresh or data signature changed.\n- Poll loop remains 4s but now avoids unnecessary redraws.\n\n2) Interaction-aware refresh pause\n- Added guards:\n  - `copyInFlight`\n  - `refreshPauseUntil`\n  - `isUserInteracting()` checks for:\n    - active text input focus\n    - active text selection\n    - copy action in progress\n- Non-forced polling skips refresh during interaction.\n\n3) Preserve scroll/selection\n- Added `captureUiState()` / `restoreUiState()`:\n  - preserves window scroll\n  - request list/detail scrollTop\n  - input focus and selection range\n- State restoration runs after data-changing refresh cycles.\n\n4) Manual refresh control\n- Added toolbar button:\n  - `Refresh Now`\n- Button triggers immediate forced refresh (`refresh(true)`).\n\nRefresh handling strategy (short)\n- Strategy combines signature-based change detection + interaction pause + UI state restoration.\n- Poll still fetches, but render work is skipped unless data changed.\n- During copy/selection/focus interactions, background refresh is deferred to prevent UX interruption.\n\nMinimal diff summary\n- `commscribe/ui/index.html`\n  - Added `Refresh Now` button\n  - Added smart refresh state/signature helpers\n  - Added interaction detection and UI-state capture/restore\n  - Updated poll loop from unconditional redraw to conditional refresh path",
      "evidence": "Verification executed\n- `python3 -m unittest commscribe.tests.test_communicate_ui -v`\n- Result: 8 tests passed.\n\nManual verification steps\n1) Repeated polls with unchanged data:\n- Keep UI open with no new requests; confirm no visible redraw churn.\n\n2) Scroll preservation:\n- Scroll request list/detail panel, wait for poll cycle, confirm position remains stable.\n\n3) Copy/selection safety:\n- Select text in detail/output and keep selection active through poll interval.\n- Confirm refresh does not interrupt selection.\n- Click `Copy Output`; confirm copy completes and button feedback appears.\n\n4) Manual refresh:\n- Click `Refresh Now`; confirm immediate refresh happens.\n\n5) Existing behavior intact:\n- Request selection/navigation and Copy REQ Link continue to work.",
      "next_steps_if_blocked": "",
      "objective": "codex> Implement smart refresh control in Communicate UI"
    },
