g Phase (Deferred)\n\nNormalize to pure lifespan.\n\nRemove demo overrides.\n\nRemove transitional env flags.\n\nHarden metrics formally.\n\nValidate async lifecycle under full coverage suite.\n\nRisk Reality\n\nRight now the largest exposure is external surface risk, not internal architecture debt.\n\nArchitecture debt affects maintainability.\nSurface exposure affects compromise.\n\nGiven demo constraint, protect the surface and freeze architecture.",
