      "request_text": "se_agent>\n\nTitle:\nMarket-Watch App Favicon (Primary) \u2013 SVG Icon Implementation\n\nProblem Type:\nprescriptive\n\nObjective:\nCreate a production-ready SVG favicon for the main Market-Watch app featuring:\n\n* A capital \u201cM\u201d structure\n* A profit/gains arrow that:\n\n  * Forms the second upward stroke of the \u201cM\u201d\n  * Crosses the center of the SVG\n  * Continues upward at a reasonable angle\n  * Terminates toward the top-right corner\n* Balanced composition\n* Clean geometry\n* Works at 16x16, 32x32, 48x48, 64x64\n* Visually pairable with the Communicate UI favicon\n\nScope:\nIncluded:\n\n* static/favicon.svg (primary vector source)\n* static/favicon.ico (multi-resolution export)\n* HTML <link> tag update in main app template\n\nExcluded:\n\n* Backend changes\n* Runtime logic\n* Communicate UI icon (handled separately)\n\nConstraints:\nBinding:\n\n* Pure SVG (no raster-only source)\n* Single-color primary version (dark background compatible)\n* Must remain legible at 16x16\n* No gradients in base version\n* Balanced stroke weight\n* Arrow must be integral to the \u201cM\u201d, not floating\n\nSoft:\n\n* Modern minimal aesthetic\n* Slight upward dynamic energy\n* Clean mathematical symmetry\n\nIgnored:\n\n* Animation\n* External CDN assets\n\n---\n\nImplementation:\n\nCreate file:\n\nstatic/favicon.svg\n\nSVG content:\n\n```xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n  <!-- Background -->\n  <rect width=\"100\" height=\"100\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/>\n\n  <!-- M Left Stroke -->\n  <path d=\"M18 78 L35 28\"\n        stroke=\"#22c55e\"\n        stroke-width=\"10\"\n        stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n        stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n        fill=\"none\"/>\n\n  <!-- M Middle Down Stroke -->\n  <path d=\"M35 28 L50 60\"\n        stroke=\"#22c55e\"\n        stroke-width=\"10\"\n        stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n        stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n        fill=\"none\"/>\n\n  <!-- Profit Arrow (forms right M + breakout) -->\n  <path d=\"M50 60 L68 32 L85 18\"\n        stroke=\"#22c55e\"\n        stroke-width=\"10\"\n        stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n        stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n        fill=\"none\"/>\n\n  <!-- Arrow Head -->\n  <polygon points=\"85,18 78,20 82,25\"\n           fill=\"#22c55e\"/>\n\n</svg>\n```\n\nDesign Rationale:\n\n* Left stroke anchors stability.\n* Middle dip creates traditional \u201cM\u201d.\n* Arrow stroke replaces right leg of \u201cM\u201d.\n* Arrow breaks upward beyond baseline height.\n* Visual center crossing occurs at approx (50,60).\n* Angle \u2248 35\u201340 degrees for natural \u201cgrowth\u201d feel.\n* Balanced negative space around shape.\n* Stroke width chosen for small-size clarity.\n\n---\n\nExport:\n\nGenerate favicon.ico containing:\n\n* 16x16\n* 32x32\n* 48x48\n* 64x64\n\nUse:\n\n```\nconvert static/favicon.svg -define icon:auto-resize=64,48,32,16 static/favicon.ico\n```\n\n(or equivalent tooling)\n\n---\n\nHTML Integration:\n\nIn main app template:\n\n```\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/static/favicon.svg\">\n<link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"/static/favicon.ico\">\n```\n\n---\n\nVerification:\n\n1. Load site in browser.\n\n2. Confirm:\n\n   * Icon visible in tab.\n   * Legible at small size.\n   * Arrow clearly forms right side of \u201cM\u201d.\n   * No clipping.\n   * Balanced visual weight.\n\n3. Test on:\n\n   * Chrome\n   * Firefox\n   * Safari\n\n4. Confirm no 404 on favicon request.\n\n---\n\nDeliverables:\n\n* static/favicon.svg\n* static/favicon.ico\n* HTML head updated\n* No runtime changes\n* No JS changes\n\nExecution complete.",
      "codex_ack_plan": "Implement primary app favicon spec by updating static/favicon.svg to the requested M+arrow geometry, generate static/favicon.ico multi-size export (64/48/32/16), and ensure main app head includes svg + alternate ico favicon links. Then verify file presence and link paths before completion.",
      "execution_log": "- 2026-02-17T04:19:17+00:00 Updated static/favicon.svg to requested M-plus-profit-arrow geometry, wired alternate icon links in static/index.html to /favicon.ico, and generated static/favicon.ico with 64/48/32/16 embedded sizes via Python fallback.",
      "outputs": "Implemented primary app favicon deliverables: updated static/favicon.svg to an M+profit-arrow composition with dark-compatible single-color mark; generated static/favicon.ico containing 64/48/32/16 resolutions; and updated main app HTML head favicon links to include svg + alternate ico paths. No backend/runtime/JS behavior changes were made.",
      "evidence": "Files updated: static/favicon.svg, static/favicon.ico (new), static/index.html. Verification:  returned sizes [(16, 16), (32, 32), (48, 48), (64, 64)]. Link verification:  shows svg + /favicon.ico entries in head.",
      "next_steps_if_blocked": "",
      "objective": "se_agent>"
