      "request_text": "se_agent>\n\nTitle:\nImplement Phase 1 \u2013 Structural Accuracy Layer (Tier A Realism Upgrades)\n\nProblem Type:\nprescriptive\n\nObjective:\nImplement Tier A realism upgrades from the Prioritized Realism Upgrade Plan:\n\n1. CorporateActionModel\n2. CostBasisEngine\n3. SettlementEngine\n\nThese must be implemented as structural, modular components without breaking existing behavior. Gross-only flows must continue to function if new modules are disabled.\n\nScope:\n\nIncluded:\n\n* New domain modules:\n\n  * CorporateActionModel\n  * CostBasisEngine\n  * SettlementEngine\n* Integration into:\n\n  * PerformanceEngine\n  * TaxModel (dependency only, no tax overhaul)\n  * ComplianceModel (cash availability check)\n* Database schema extensions (non-breaking)\n* Unit tests\n* Spec update if required\n\nExcluded:\n\n* Enhanced MarginModel (Tier B)\n* FX Timing Refinement (Tier B)\n* Wash-sale logic (Phase 3)\n* Execution microstructure overhaul\n* UI redesign\n\nTime Horizon:\nSingle structured implementation phase\n\nConstraints:\n\nBinding:\n\n* Must preserve backward compatibility.\n* Existing gross PnL logic must still compute if new modules disabled.\n* No silent breaking of existing trade flows.\n* New logic must be modular and injectable.\n* All new modules must be unit-tested.\n* No destructive migrations.\n* Deterministic behavior only (no stochastic modeling).\n\nSoft:\n\n* Favor composition over inheritance.\n* Clear separation of concerns.\n* Config-driven enable/disable flags.\n\nIgnored:\n\n* Historical data backfill automation (manual recalculation acceptable).\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1 \u2014 CORPORATE ACTION MODEL\n\n1. Create module:\n\n   server/domain/corporate_actions.py\n\nDefine:\n\nCorporateActionEvent:\n- event_id\n- symbol\n- action_type (SPLIT, REVERSE_SPLIT, DIVIDEND, MERGER, SPINOFF, SYMBOL_CHANGE)\n- effective_date\n- ratio (for splits)\n- cash_amount (for dividends)\n- metadata (JSON)\n\nCorporateActionModel:\n- register_event(event)\n- apply_to_position(position, event)\n- apply_to_lots(lots, event)\n- adjust_cost_basis(lots, event)\n- handle_symbol_change(position, event)\n\nRequired behaviors:\n\nSPLIT:\n- Adjust share quantity\n- Adjust cost basis proportionally\n\nREVERSE_SPLIT:\n- Adjust quantity downward\n- Preserve total basis\n\nDIVIDEND:\n- Record cash inflow\n- No share count change\n\nSYMBOL_CHANGE:\n- Update symbol across open positions\n\nMERGER/SPINOFF:\n- Placeholder logic:\n- Adjust symbol and/or split lots\n- No complex valuation logic yet\n\nIntegration:\n\n* PerformanceEngine must process corporate actions before computing PnL.\n* CostBasisEngine must recalc basis after action.\n\nAdd config toggle:\n\n```\nenable_corporate_actions = true\n```\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 2 \u2014 COST BASIS ENGINE\n\n2. Create module:\n\n   server/domain/cost_basis.py\n\nDefine:\n\nLot:\n- lot_id\n- symbol\n- quantity\n- entry_price\n- entry_date\n- remaining_quantity\n- adjusted_cost_basis\n\nCostBasisEngine:\n- add_lot(trade)\n- close_lot(trade, method)\n- compute_realized_gain(exit_trade)\n- apply_corporate_action(event)\n- get_open_lots(symbol)\n\nSupport methods:\n\n```\nFIFO\nLIFO\nSPECIFIC_ID (placeholder interface)\n```\n\nBehavior:\n\n* Track lots per symbol.\n* On sell:\n\n  * Close lots according to method.\n  * Compute realized gain per lot.\n* Must return:\n\n  * realized_gain\n  * holding_period_days\n\nTaxModel must consume realized_gain from CostBasisEngine instead of gross trade diff.\n\nBackward compatibility:\n\nIf CostBasisEngine disabled:\n- Fallback to legacy gross calculation.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3 \u2014 SETTLEMENT ENGINE\n\n3. Create module:\n\n   server/domain/settlement.py\n\nDefine:\n\nSettlementEngine:\n- register_trade(trade, market_profile)\n- compute_settlement_date(trade_date, market_profile)\n- update_unsettled_cash()\n- get_available_cash()\n- validate_cash_trade(trade)\n\nMarketProfile must define:\n\n```\nsettlement_cycle (T+1, T+2)\n```\n\nBehavior:\n\nCash account:\n- Sale proceeds unavailable until settlement date.\n- Prevent purchase if insufficient settled cash.\n\nMargin account:\n- Settlement does not block trade (still tracked).\n\nIntegration:\n\nComplianceModel must call:\n\n```\nSettlementEngine.validate_cash_trade()\n```\n\nbefore execution for cash accounts.\n\nAdd config:\n\n```\nenable_settlement_enforcement = true\n```\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4 \u2014 PERFORMANCE ENGINE INTEGRATION\n\nModify PerformanceEngine:\n\nExecution order:\n\n1. Compliance validation\n2. Broker execution\n3. CorporateActionModel (if applicable)\n4. CostBasisEngine update\n5. Compute realized gain\n6. CostModel apply\n7. TaxModel estimate\n8. SettlementEngine register\n9. Aggregate portfolio metrics\n\nEnsure:\n\n* gross_pnl preserved\n* net_pnl uses CostModel\n* after_tax_pnl uses CostBasisEngine + TaxModel\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 5 \u2014 DATABASE EXTENSIONS\n\nAdd non-breaking columns:\n\nTrade table:\n- lot_id (nullable)\n- realized_gain\n- settlement_date\n- corporate_action_flag\n\nCreate new tables:\n\ncorporate_actions\nlots\n\nDo not drop or modify existing columns.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 6 \u2014 TESTING\n\nAdd tests under:\n\ntests/domain/\n\nTest coverage:\n\nCorporateActionModel:\n- Split adjustment\n- Reverse split\n- Dividend cash credit\n\nCostBasisEngine:\n- FIFO lot closing\n- LIFO closing\n- Realized gain correctness\n- Holding period classification\n\nSettlementEngine:\n- T+1 vs T+2 calculation\n- Cash restriction enforcement\n- Margin account bypass\n\nIntegration test:\n\nFull lifecycle:\n- Buy\n- Split event\n- Sell\n- Verify realized gain + cost basis + settlement\n\nAll tests must pass.\n\n---\n\n## DELIVERABLES\n\n1. New modules:\n\n   * corporate_actions.py\n   * cost_basis.py\n   * settlement.py\n\n2. Modified:\n\n   * PerformanceEngine integration\n   * ComplianceModel hook\n\n3. DB migration scripts\n\n4. Test suite additions\n\n5. Diff summary\n\n6. Confirmation:\n\n   * Backward compatibility preserved\n   * No regression in existing flows\n   * Corporate actions processed deterministically\n   * Cost basis accurate\n   * Settlement enforcement functional\n\n---\n\n## VALIDATION CRITERIA\n\n* Existing tests pass.\n* New tests pass.\n* Gross-only mode still works if modules disabled.\n* No circular dependencies.\n* No business logic removed.\n* No performance degradation >10% in backtests.\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nStructured:\n\n* Modules Added\n* Files Modified\n* Migration Summary\n* Test Summary\n* Integration Notes\n* Backward Compatibility Confirmation\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
