      "request_text": "se_agent>\n\nTitle:\nEnforce Mandatory Verification Block in PROJECT_RUNTIME + Extend Communicate Schema + Add Validator Script\n\nProblem Type:\nprescriptive\n\nObjective:\nUpgrade runtime governance to require a structured VERIFICATION REPORT block for every REQ marked DONE, extend the communicate schema to support verification tracking, and implement an automated validator script that prevents invalid DONE states.\n\nThis must:\n\n* Enforce structured completion auditing.\n* Prevent DONE status without verification.\n* Preserve backward compatibility.\n* Not break existing commscribe workflows.\n* Not alter business logic.\n\nScope:\n\nIncluded:\n\n* Update ai_runtime/PROJECT_RUNTIME.md\n* Extend commscribe/communicate.json schema\n* Modify communicate lifecycle expectations (non-breaking)\n* Add validator script:\n  scripts/ai_runtime/validate_req_completion.py\n* Optional integration hook for communicate_scan\n\nExcluded:\n\n* UI redesign\n* Business logic changes\n* Governance threshold logic changes\n* Coverage engine changes\n\nTime Horizon:\nSingle structured enforcement upgrade\n\nConstraints:\n\nBinding:\n\n* DONE status requires VERIFICATION REPORT block.\n* All objectives must be explicitly addressed.\n* Validator must detect missing sections.\n* Validator must not modify REQ automatically.\n* Backward compatibility maintained for older REQs.\n* No destructive changes.\n\nSoft:\n\n* Clear structured output.\n* Machine-parseable verification block.\n* Deterministic validation logic.\n\nIgnored:\n\n* Cosmetic formatting.\n* Narrative tone enforcement.\n\n---\n\n## PART 1 \u2014 UPDATE PROJECT_RUNTIME.md\n\nAppend new section:\n\n---\n\nSECTION \u2014 REQUIRED VERIFICATION BLOCK (MANDATORY)\n\nAny REQ marked DONE must include a structured block titled:\n\n```\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n```\n\nThis block must contain:\n\n1. Objectives Addressed:\n\n   * Each original objective enumerated.\n   * Status: COMPLETE | PARTIAL | FAILED\n   * Method: brief description of verification method.\n\n2. Quality Checks:\n\n   * Typographical review: PASS | FAIL | N/A\n   * Math/logic validation: PASS | FAIL | N/A\n   * Empty field validation: PASS | FAIL | N/A\n   * Dependency integrity check: PASS | FAIL\n   * Regression risk check: PASS | FAIL\n   * Changelog updated: YES | NO\n   * Tests executed: YES | NO\n   * Coverage delta: numeric or N/A\n\n3. Artifacts:\n\n   * Files modified\n   * Files added\n   * Files removed\n   * Reports generated (path)\n\n4. Outstanding Risks:\n\n   * NONE or list\n\n5. Final Status:\n\n   * DONE | BLOCKED\n\nEnforcement Rules:\n\n* A REQ cannot be marked DONE if:\n\n  * VERIFICATION REPORT block missing.\n  * Any objective marked FAILED.\n  * Any required quality check FAIL without explanation.\n* If missing:\n\n  * Status must revert to IN_PROGRESS.\n* communicate_scan must treat incomplete verification as error.\n\n---\n\n---\n\n## PART 2 \u2014 EXTEND COMMUNICATE SCHEMA\n\nModify commscribe/communicate.json structure:\n\nFor each REQ:\n\nAdd new fields:\n\n\"verification\": {\n\"objectives\": [\n{\n\"description\": \"\",\n\"status\": \"COMPLETE|PARTIAL|FAILED\",\n\"method\": \"\"\n}\n],\n\"quality_checks\": {\n\"typo_check\": \"PASS|FAIL|N/A\",\n\"math_validation\": \"PASS|FAIL|N/A\",\n\"empty_field_check\": \"PASS|FAIL|N/A\",\n\"dependency_check\": \"PASS|FAIL\",\n\"regression_check\": \"PASS|FAIL\",\n\"changelog_updated\": \"YES|NO\",\n\"tests_executed\": \"YES|NO\",\n\"coverage_delta\": \"\"\n},\n\"artifacts\": {\n\"files_modified\": [],\n\"files_added\": [],\n\"files_removed\": [],\n\"reports_generated\": []\n},\n\"outstanding_risks\": []\n}\n\nRules:\n\n* verification field required if status == DONE.\n* verification optional if status != DONE.\n* communicate_scan must validate structure.\n\nDo not remove existing fields.\n\n---\n\n## PART 3 \u2014 IMPLEMENT VALIDATOR SCRIPT\n\nCreate:\n\nscripts/ai_runtime/validate_req_completion.py\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n1. Load commscribe/communicate.json\n\n2. For each REQ:\n   If status == DONE:\n   - Ensure verification exists.\n   - Ensure objectives array non-empty.\n   - Ensure no objective has status FAILED.\n   - Ensure required quality checks present.\n   - Ensure Final Status == DONE.\n\n3. Validate communicate.md contains:\n   --- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n   for each DONE REQ.\n\n4. Output:\n\nIf all valid:\nVALIDATION: PASSED\n\nIf invalid:\nVALIDATION: FAILED\nList:\n- REQ ID\n- Missing components\n\n5. Exit codes:\n   0 \u2192 valid\n   1 \u2192 invalid\n\nNo auto-fixes.\n\n---\n\n## PART 4 \u2014 INTEGRATE INTO communicate_scan\n\nUpdate communicate_scan system-status to:\n\n* Call validate_req_completion.py\n* If validation fails:\n  system-status != SYSTEM_OK\n  Print validation failure summary\n\n---\n\n## PART 5 \u2014 ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA\n\nUpgrade complete when:\n\n* PROJECT_RUNTIME.md contains REQUIRED VERIFICATION BLOCK section.\n* communicate.json schema extended.\n* Validator script exists and executable.\n* communicate_scan integrates validator.\n* Existing REQs without verification do not fail unless marked DONE.\n* New DONE REQs require verification.\n* No regression in commscribe lifecycle.\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nStructured:\n\n* Files Modified\n* Files Created\n* Schema Changes\n* Validator Logic Summary\n* Integration Notes\n* Backward Compatibility Confirmation\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
