      "request_text": "se_agent>\n\nTitle:\nVerification Enforcement Test \u2013 Communicate Workflow\n\nProblem Type:\ndescriptive + prescriptive\n\nObjective:\nProvide a deterministic test sequence to verify that the new verification enforcement layer is functioning correctly and that the communicate workflow does not allow a REQ to be marked DONE without a valid VERIFICATION REPORT block.\n\nScope:\n\nIncluded:\n\n* Manual test sequence\n* Expected outputs\n* Failure-state confirmation\n* Exit-code validation\n* communicate_scan validation\n\nExcluded:\n\n* Code changes\n* Schema changes\n* Business logic testing\n\nTime Horizon:\nImmediate validation test\n\nConstraints:\n\nBinding:\n\n* Must test both failure and success conditions.\n* Must test validator script directly.\n* Must test communicate_scan integration.\n* Must not modify production data.\n* Must not break existing REQs.\n\n---\n\n## TEST 1 \u2014 FAILURE CASE (DONE WITHOUT VERIFICATION)\n\nStep 1:\nCreate a test REQ entry via communicate:\n\n```\ncommunicate\n```\n\nCreate REQ with:\nStatus: DONE\nNo VERIFICATION REPORT block\nNo verification object in communicate.json\n\nStep 2:\nRun:\n\n```\npython3 scripts/ai_runtime/validate_req_completion.py\n```\n\nExpected:\nVALIDATION: FAILED\nExit code: 1\nOutput lists REQ ID missing verification\n\nStep 3:\nRun:\n\n```\ncommunicate_scan system-status\n```\n\nExpected:\nsystem-status != SYSTEM_OK\nOutput indicates verification enforcement failure\n\nIf system-status returns SYSTEM_OK \u2192 enforcement not active.\n\n---\n\n## TEST 2 \u2014 PARTIAL FAILURE (FAILED OBJECTIVE)\n\nStep 1:\nAdd verification block with:\n\n```\nOne objective status = FAILED\n```\n\nStep 2:\nRun validator:\n\n```\npython3 scripts/ai_runtime/validate_req_completion.py\n```\n\nExpected:\nVALIDATION: FAILED\nExit code: 1\nExplicit reason:\nObjective marked FAILED\n\n---\n\n## TEST 3 \u2014 SUCCESS CASE (VALID DONE)\n\nStep 1:\nUpdate REQ:\n\nInclude full:\n\n```\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n```\n\nWith:\nAll objectives COMPLETE\nAll required quality checks PASS or N/A\nNo FAILED status\nFinal Status: DONE\n\nEnsure communicate.json includes verification object.\n\nStep 2:\nRun:\n\n```\npython3 scripts/ai_runtime/validate_req_completion.py\n```\n\nExpected:\nVALIDATION: PASSED\nExit code: 0\n\nStep 3:\nRun:\n\n```\ncommunicate_scan system-status\n```\n\nExpected:\nSYSTEM_OK\n\n---\n\n## TEST 4 \u2014 LEGACY REQ COMPATIBILITY\n\nStep 1:\nLocate older REQ not marked DONE.\n\nStep 2:\nRun validator.\n\nExpected:\nNo failure triggered.\nOnly DONE REQs require verification.\n\n---\n\n## EXPECTED FINAL BEHAVIOR\n\nIf after running communicate you only see:\n\n```\n\"Command-word communicate workflow executed successfully.\"\n```\n\nThat means:\n\n* communicate executed lifecycle logic,\n* but validation enforcement is not wired into:\n\n  * DONE state check\n  * communicate_scan\n  * or validator script not integrated.\n\nIn that case:\n\nEnforcement integration incomplete.\n\n---\n\n## PASS CONDITION\n\nSystem is correctly enforced when:\n\n* DONE without verification \u2192 blocked\n* FAILED objective \u2192 blocked\n* Missing verification object \u2192 blocked\n* Valid verification \u2192 passes\n* communicate_scan reflects validator result\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nWhen executing this test:\n\nProvide:\n\n* REQ ID tested\n* Validator output\n* communicate_scan output\n* Exit codes\n* Final enforcement status\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
