      "request_text": "se_agent>\n\nTitle:\nDerive Standardized Communicate Output Template from Historical REQ Logs\n\nProblem Type:\ndescriptive + prescriptive\n\nObjective:\nHave the terminal LLM:\n\n1. Review historical communicate request logs (starting 2026-02-14 onward).\n2. Analyze structural patterns of output fields used in REQ completions.\n3. Identify inconsistencies, missing governance elements, and formatting drift.\n4. Derive a standardized, semi-flexible response template for future REQ outputs.\n5. Produce 1\u20132 canonical templates.\n6. Write templates into:\n\n   commscribe/docs/\n\nWithout modifying historical REQs.\n\nScope:\n\nIncluded:\n\n* commscribe/communicate.md\n* commscribe/communicate.json\n* REQ entries from 2026-02-14 onward\n* Pattern extraction\n* Template synthesis\n* Writing template files\n\nExcluded:\n\n* Editing old REQs\n* Modifying communicate engine\n* Updating runtime enforcement\n* Changing validator logic\n\nTime Horizon:\nSingle analytical pass + template generation\n\nConstraints:\n\nBinding:\n\n* Do not modify historical logs.\n* Do not retroactively alter communicate.json.\n* Templates must support:\n\n  * Delivery report\n  * Verification report\n  * Governance enforcement\n  * Optional sections\n* Templates must be structured and machine-parseable.\n* Avoid narrative language.\n* Avoid redundancy.\n\nSoft:\n\n* Balance strictness and flexibility.\n* Avoid excessive verbosity.\n* Favor deterministic ordering.\n\nIgnored:\n\n* Cosmetic whitespace issues in logs.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1 \u2014 LOG REVIEW\n\n1. Parse commscribe/communicate.md:\n\n   * Extract REQs from 2026-02-14 forward.\n   * Identify all unique section headers used.\n   * Identify recurring structural fields.\n   * Identify missing verification components.\n\n2. Parse communicate.json:\n\n   * Extract structural keys used.\n   * Identify mismatch between markdown and JSON fields.\n   * Identify drift between delivery report vs verification structure.\n\n3. Build structured analysis:\n\n   For each REQ:\n\n   * Sections present\n   * Sections missing\n   * Format consistency score\n   * Governance completeness score\n\nDo not output narrative. Output structured findings.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 2 \u2014 TEMPLATE DERIVATION\n\nBased on patterns observed:\n\nDesign:\n\nTemplate A \u2014 Standard Execution Template\nUsed for most development REQs.\n\nTemplate B \u2014 Lightweight Response Template\nUsed for informational or analysis-only REQs.\n\nEach template must include:\n\n* Metadata header\n* Change summary\n* Structured artifacts\n* --- VERIFICATION REPORT --- block\n* Final Status field\n\nTemplates must:\n\n* Clearly separate delivery vs verification.\n* Enforce ordered sections.\n* Allow optional sections via N/A.\n* Be future-compatible.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3 \u2014 OUTPUT FILES\n\nCreate directory if missing:\n\n```\ncommscribe/docs/\n```\n\nWrite:\n\n1. commscribe/docs/REQ_EXECUTION_TEMPLATE.md\n2. commscribe/docs/REQ_LIGHTWEIGHT_TEMPLATE.md\n\nEach file must contain:\n\n* Template header\n* Section ordering\n* Field placeholders\n* Usage notes (minimal)\n* Indication:\n  \u201cRequired for REQ status DONE.\u201d\n\nDo not include narrative explanation of enforcement logic.\nDo not include analysis commentary.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4 \u2014 CONSISTENCY CHECK\n\nEnsure:\n\n* Templates align with:\n\n  * communicate.json verification schema\n  * PROJECT_RUNTIME REQUIRED VERIFICATION BLOCK\n  * Validator expectations\n* No fields contradict enforcement rules.\n* Sections are in deterministic order.\n\n---\n\n## DELIVERABLES\n\n* Log Pattern Summary\n* Section Frequency Table\n* Identified Drift Report\n* Template A (Execution)\n* Template B (Lightweight)\n* File paths created\n* Confirmation no historical logs modified\n\n---\n\n## VALIDATION CRITERIA\n\n* Templates fully cover governance enforcement requirements.\n* Templates reflect observed historical patterns.\n* No duplicate semantic fields.\n* No enforcement contradictions.\n* Templates written to commscribe/docs/.\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nStructured:\n\n* Log Analysis Summary\n* Structural Gaps Identified\n* Template A Content\n* Template B Content\n* Files Created\n* Confirmation of Non-Modification\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
