      "request_text": "Title:\nRoadmap Realignment + Realism Runtime Integration Execution Contract\n\nProblem Type:\nprescriptive\n\nObjective:\nExecute the highest-impact path forward derived from the canonical roadmap review and current Multi-Market Realism implementation state by:\n\nRealigning the roadmap artifact to reflect actual workstreams and current completion state.\n\nMaking the realism domain layer authoritative in the live trade execution path (runtime integration).\n\nHardening the cost model from a single-rate approximation to a componentized fee/friction model.\n\nHardening the tax model integration and config profiles (estimated-only, jurisdiction-aware scaffolding).\n\nAdding Tier B skeleton modules (MarginModel, FX timing) as gated placeholders with deterministic tests.\n\nScope / Workstreams:\n\nWorkstream A \u2014 Roadmap Realignment (Docs-only)\nWorkstream B \u2014 Runtime Integration (Authoritative pipeline)\nWorkstream C \u2014 Componentized Cost Model\nWorkstream D \u2014 Tax Model Hardening (scaffold + wiring)\nWorkstream E \u2014 Tier B Skeletonization (Margin + FX)\n\nExcluded:\n\nML/Strategy work (legacy roadmap I/J)\n\nAgent coordination expansion (legacy roadmap K)\n\nUI expansion\n\nLarge refactors unrelated to integration\n\nInternational market full implementation beyond explicit placeholders\n\nConstraints:\n\nBinding:\n\nPreserve backward compatibility via config gates.\n\nNo silent breaking changes to existing trade flow.\n\nDo not delete legacy logic until replacement path is verified.\n\nAll new behaviors must have deterministic unit tests.\n\nUpdate changelog / release notes if present.\n\nAll work must be logged via commscribe with DONE requiring a VERIFICATION REPORT.\n\nAvoid speculative features; implement only what is required for authoritative integration.\n\nSoft:\n\nMinimal diff per commit group.\n\nClear module boundaries (SRP).\n\nKeep folder structure stable unless necessary.\n\nIgnored (for now):\n\nFull international execution semantics\n\nComplex merger/spinoff valuation logic\n\nWash-sale logic\n\nWORKSTREAM A \u2014 ROADMAP REALIGNMENT\n\nTasks:\n\nA1) Identify canonical roadmap file:\n\nUse existing canonical roadmap output artifact to locate most current roadmap file.\n\nIf ROADMAP.md missing at root, create root ROADMAP.md that points to canonical doc or becomes canonical.\n\nA2) Add new section:\nPhase R \u2014 Multi-Market Realism Track\n\nInclude subsections:\n\nR1 \u2014 Tier A Structural Modules (Corporate Actions, Cost Basis, Settlement)\n\nR2 \u2014 Runtime Integration (authoritative execution wiring)\n\nR3 \u2014 Fee/Tax Production Wiring\n\nR4 \u2014 Tier B (Margin/FX)\n\nR5 \u2014 International Expansion (placeholder)\n\nA3) Set statuses:\n\nR1: ~90% module-level complete (cite modules/tests)\n\nR2: NOT COMPLETE\n\nR3: PARTIAL\n\nR4: NOT STARTED\n\nR5: NOT STARTED\n\nA4) Ensure roadmap explicitly states:\n\n\u201cModule-level realism \u2260 operational realism until runtime wiring is complete.\u201d\n\nDeliverable:\n\nUpdated canonical roadmap file(s) with Phase R inserted and status corrected.\n\nWORKSTREAM B \u2014 RUNTIME INTEGRATION (AUTHORITATIVE PIPELINE)\n\nGoal:\nRoute all executed trades through the realism pipeline so that realized gains, costs, taxes, and settlement become authoritative for portfolio analytics.\n\nTasks:\n\nB1) Locate existing live execution path:\n\nIdentify where trades are executed and where PnL/analytics are computed.\n\nIdentify current \u201clegacy\u201d PnL calculation locations.\n\nB2) Define authoritative pipeline order:\nCompliance\n\u2192 CorporateAction apply\n\u2192 CostBasis update + realized gain\n\u2192 CostModel fees/friction \u2192 net pnl\n\u2192 TaxModel estimate \u2192 after-tax\n\u2192 Settlement register/gate\n\u2192 Aggregation output\n\nB3) Implement integration without breaking legacy:\n\nAdd config gate:\nENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE=true\n\nDefault to false if risk is high; otherwise default true in demo/dev only.\n\nWhen gate enabled, replace analytics computation source with PerformanceEngine outputs.\n\nKeep legacy path as fallback.\n\nB4) Ensure domain modules are imported and used by runtime.\n\nEliminate \u201ctests-only\u201d isolation.\n\nB5) Add integration tests:\n\nAt least 1 deterministic end-to-end trade scenario:\nbuy \u2192 corporate action (split) \u2192 sell \u2192 verify:\n\nrealized gain matches lot accounting\n\nfees applied\n\ntax estimate applied\n\nsettlement fields set\n\naggregate output contains gross/net/after-tax\n\nDeliverables:\n\nLive runtime path uses PerformanceEngine under gate.\n\nIntegration test suite proving wiring.\n\nWORKSTREAM C \u2014 COMPONENTIZED COST MODEL\n\nGoal:\nReplace single cost_rate approximation with explicit fee components.\n\nTasks:\n\nC1) Create CostModel interface:\n\nComponents:\ncommission\nspread\nslippage\nregulatory_fees\nborrow_fee (if short)\nmargin_interest\nfx_spread (if FX applied)\nsession_multiplier (pre/after-hours liquidity impact)\n\nC2) Add configuration schema:\n\nFee schedules per broker/market profile.\n\nC3) Persist/return fee breakdown:\n\nEnsure trade analytics output includes fee breakdown fields.\n\nC4) Tests:\n\nDeterministic tests validating:\n\ncomponent sum equals total cost\n\nsession multiplier changes slippage/spread\n\nshort borrow fee applied only when short\n\nDeliverables:\n\nComponentized CostModel integrated into PerformanceEngine pipeline.\n\nWORKSTREAM D \u2014 TAX MODEL HARDENING\n\nGoal:\nMake tax estimation explicit, configurable, and wired to realized gains.\n\nTasks:\n\nD1) Add tax profile adapter(s):\n\nConfigurable:\n\njurisdiction\n\nshort/long rates\n\noptional state rate\n\nestimated-only boundary + disclaimer enforcement flag\n\nD2) Ensure TaxModel consumes:\n\nrealized gain from CostBasisEngine\n\nholding period classification\n\nD3) Add placeholders:\n\nforeign withholding\n\nforeign tax credit (placeholder)\n\nD4) Tests:\n\nshort vs long holding period rate selection\n\njurisdiction profile selection\n\nDeliverables:\n\nTaxModel production wiring with deterministic tests.\n\nWORKSTREAM E \u2014 TIER B SKELETONIZATION (MARGIN + FX)\n\nGoal:\nConvert \u201cmissing\u201d Tier B areas into explicit gated scaffolding with tests.\n\nTasks:\n\nE1) Add MarginModel skeleton:\n\nConfig gate ENABLE_MARGIN_MODEL\n\nInterfaces:\ncompute_required_margin(position)\ncompute_margin_interest(balance, days)\n\nDeterministic placeholder behavior + tests.\n\nE2) Add FX timing skeleton:\n\nConfig gate ENABLE_FX_TIMING\n\nModes:\nTRADE_DATE\nSETTLEMENT_DATE\n\nDeterministic placeholder conversion path + tests.\n\nDeliverables:\n\nTier B modules exist, gated, and tested.\n\nEXECUTION ORDER (MANDATORY)\n\nWorkstream A (roadmap alignment)\n\nWorkstream B (runtime integration)\n\nWorkstream C (cost model)\n\nWorkstream D (tax hardening)\n\nWorkstream E (Tier B skeletons)\n\nDo not start C/D/E until B is wired and tested.\n\nVERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS (DONE GATE)\n\nFor each REQ marked DONE, output:\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n\nInclude:\n\nObjectives Addressed (each item COMPLETE/PARTIAL/FAILED + method)\n\nQuality Checks:\n\nTypographical review\n\nMath/logic validation\n\nDependency integrity\n\nRegression risk\n\nChangelog updated\n\nTests executed\n\nCoverage delta\n\nArtifacts (files changed/added/removed, reports)\n\nOutstanding Risks (or NONE)\n\nFinal Status\n\nDONE is invalid if verification block missing.\n\nDELIVERABLES\n\nUpdated roadmap with Phase R.\n\nRuntime integration of PerformanceEngine under config gate.\n\nComponentized CostModel.\n\nTaxModel hardened profiles + wiring.\n\nTier B skeleton modules (Margin + FX).\n\nDeterministic tests for each workstream.\n\nDiff summary per workstream.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n\nStructured only:\n\nWork Completed (by Workstream)\n\nFiles Added / Modified\n\nTest Commands Executed + Results\n\nCoverage Delta (if available)\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n\nFinal Status\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
