      "request_text": "TITLE\nPhase R2 Slice 1 \u2014 Deficiency Remediation: Regression Assertion Hardening\n\nPROBLEM TYPE\nprescriptive (targeted corrective execution)\n\nOBJECTIVE\nEliminate identified compliance deficiencies by strengthening regression guarantees for legacy field invariance when persisting realism_pipeline_enabled.\n\nINPUT\n\nExisting implementation of Slice 1\n\nExisting tests in tests/test_analytics_store.py\n\nPrior compliance report identifying R5 and R9 partial satisfaction \n\ncodex's_response\n\nREQUIRED ACTIONS\n\nStrengthen Gate-Off Test\n\nExplicitly assert that all pre-existing required trade fields remain unchanged.\n\nCompare persisted record (excluding realism_pipeline_enabled) against baseline snapshot.\n\nStrengthen Gate-On Test\n\nAssert no unintended mutation of unrelated fields.\n\nConfirm addition of only one new field relative to baseline.\n\nAdd Deterministic Baseline Comparator\n\nCreate helper assertion inside test module (not production code).\n\nComparator must:\n\nAccept baseline dict and persisted dict.\n\nIgnore only realism_pipeline_enabled.\n\nFail if any other key differs or new unexpected key appears.\n\nDo NOT modify production code unless required for test determinism.\n\nDo NOT introduce new Phase R2 functionality.\n\nDo NOT refactor persistence layer.\n\nVERIFICATION COMMAND\n\nRun:\n\npython3 -m pytest -q tests/test_analytics_store.py\n\n\nREQUIRED OUTPUT\n\nSECTION 1 \u2014 Test Modifications\n\nIdentify modified test file(s).\n\nBrief summary of added assertions (no full file dump).\n\nSECTION 2 \u2014 Regression Assertion Proof\n\nDemonstrate comparator logic in use.\n\nShow example assertion structure.\n\nSECTION 3 \u2014 Pytest Result\n\nFull pytest summary line.\n\nTotal tests passed.\n\nSECTION 4 \u2014 Compliance Reclassification\n\nConfirm whether R5 and R9 now qualify as SATISFIED.\n\nCONSTRAINTS\n\nNo scope expansion.\n\nNo additional Phase tasks.\n\nNo architectural redesign.\n\nStop after remediation verification.\n\nEND OF INSTRUCTION",
