      "execution_log": "- 2026-02-18T03:39:09+00:00 Hardened regression assertions in tests/test_analytics_store.py with deterministic baseline comparator and single-field-addition guard; verified requested pytest scope passes.",
      "outputs": "SECTION 1 \u2014 Test Modifications\nModified file(s):\n- tests/test_analytics_store.py\n\nAdded assertions summary:\n- Added helper comparator `_assert_trade_matches_baseline_except_realism(baseline, persisted)` that ignores only `realism_pipeline_enabled` and fails on any other key/value mismatch.\n- Strengthened Gate-Off test to:\n  - use deterministic baseline with fixed timestamp and expected legacy/default fields,\n  - assert `realism_pipeline_enabled` is present and False,\n  - assert persisted record is identical to baseline for all non-realism fields.\n- Strengthened Gate-On test to:\n  - use deterministic baseline with fixed timestamp and expected legacy/default fields,\n  - assert `realism_pipeline_enabled` is present and True,\n  - assert exactly one added key vs baseline (`realism_pipeline_enabled`),\n  - assert all non-realism fields are unchanged via comparator.\n\nSECTION 2 \u2014 Regression Assertion Proof\nComparator logic in use:\n- Key-set invariant (excluding realism):\n  - `baseline_keys = set(baseline.keys())`\n  - `persisted_keys = set(persisted.keys()) - {\"realism_pipeline_enabled\"}`\n  - assert equality of key sets.\n- Value invariant for each key in baseline:\n  - `assert baseline[key] == persisted[key]`.\n\nExample assertion structure:\n- Gate-Off:\n  - `self.assertFalse(persisted[\"realism_pipeline_enabled\"])`\n  - `self._assert_trade_matches_baseline_except_realism(baseline, persisted)`\n- Gate-On:\n  - `added_keys = set(persisted.keys()) - set(baseline.keys())`\n  - `self.assertEqual(added_keys, {\"realism_pipeline_enabled\"})`\n  - `self._assert_trade_matches_baseline_except_realism(baseline, persisted)`\n\nSECTION 3 \u2014 Pytest Result\nFull pytest summary line:\n- `................................                                         [100%]`\n\nTotal tests passed:\n- `32 passed in 0.91s`\n\nSECTION 4 \u2014 Compliance Reclassification\n- R5: SATISFIED\n- R9: SATISFIED",
