us | Integration Status | Gap Type |\n\nGAP TYPE CLASSIFICATION:\n\n* Documentation drift\n* Runtime integration missing\n* Testing gap\n* Feature not started\n* Phase misclassified\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3 \u2014 DETERMINE TRUE \u201cNEXT\u201d\n\nBASED ON:\n\n* Risk\n* Architectural leverage\n* Dependency order\n* Acceptance criteria requirements\n\nIDENTIFY:\n\n1. Authoritative next milestone.\n2. Whether it belongs under:\n\n   * Phase H\n   * Phase M\n   * Phase F\n   * Or new Phase R.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4 \u2014 DEFINE NEXT EXECUTION CONTRACT\n\nOUTPUT STRUCTURED CONTRACT FOR THE NEXT PHASE INCLUDING:\n\n* Title\n* Problem Type\n* Objective\n* Scope\n* Constraints\n* Required integration points\n* Tests required\n* Verification requirements\n* Deliverables\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nSTRUCTURED ONLY:\n\n* Roadmap Phase Snapshot\n* Realism Phase Snapshot\n* Alignment Matrix\n* Drift Summary\n* Deterministic Next Phase\n* Execution Contract\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
