Ignored:\n\n* Cosmetic formatting changes.\n* Non-runtime documentation edits.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1 \u2014 AUTHORITATIVE BOUNDARY DEFINITION\n\n1. Identify execution event emission path:\n\n   * agents/execution_agent.py \u2192 OrderExecuted (or equivalent execution event).\n\n2. Identify current analytics-driven realism invocation path.\n\n3. Insert authoritative realism boundary:\n\n   Execution Event\n   \u2192 PerformanceEngine.process_trade(...)\n   \u2192 cost/tax/settlement computation\n   \u2192 trade persistence\n   \u2192 analytics reads from persisted record\n\n4. Ensure no parallel legacy PnL path remains active when gate ON.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 2 \u2014 GATE ENFORCEMENT LOGIC\n\nIf ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE == true:\n- All executed trades must pass through PerformanceEngine before persistence.\n- Realism outputs must populate:\ngross_pnl\nnet_pnl\nafter_tax_pnl\nrealized_gain\ntax_estimate\nsettlement_date\nfee_breakdown\nfees_total\nrealism_pipeline_enabled=true\n\nIf ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE == false:\n- Legacy trade flow preserved.\n- realism_pipeline_enabled=false\n- Legacy fields untouched.\n\nNo mixed states allowed.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3 \u2014 PERSISTENCE ALIGNMENT\n\nEnsure:\n\n* Persistence sink (analytics/store.py or equivalent) records:\n\n  * Realism provenance flag\n  * Computed realism outputs\n* No mutation of required legacy fields.\n* Schema continuity preserved.\n\nAdd explicit error flag:\nrealism_processing_error (nullable)\n\nOn realism failure:\n- Persist trade\n- Set error flag\n- Do not crash execution path.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4 \u2014 TEST REQUIREMENTS\n\nAdd integration tests covering:\n\n1. Gate ON:\n\n   * Buy \u2192 Sell lifecycle\n   * Assert:\n\n     * All realism fields populated\n     * Values match deterministic expectation\n     * Provenance flag true\n\n2. Gate OFF:\n\n   * Same lifecycle\n   * Assert:\n\n     * Legacy fields unchanged\n     * Provenance flag false\n     * No realism outputs injected\n\n3. Determinism:\n\n   * Same input event stream twice\n   * Assert identical realism outputs\n\n4. Negative path:\n\n   * Simulate realism processing exception\n   * Assert:\n\n     * Trade persists\n     * Error flag set\n     * No execution crash\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 5 \u2014 REGRESSION PROTECTION\n\nAdd test:\n\n* Assert no direct legacy PnL calculation path invoked when gate ON.\n* Assert no duplicate PnL sources.\n\n---\n\n## VERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS\n\nREQ cannot be marked DONE unless:\n\n* All integration tests pass.\n* No duplicate PnL path remains.\n* Determinism test passes.\n* Gate OFF path verified.\n* Error handling verified.\n* Coverage for modified modules does not decrease.\n\nOutput must include:\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n\nWith:\n\n* Objectives Addressed (R2 integration items)\n* Quality Checks\n* Test evidence\n* Risk statement\n* Final Status\n\n---\n\n## DELIVERABLES\n\n* Authoritative runtime integration diff.\n* Updated execution-to-persistence wiring.\n* Integration tests.\n* Test run summary.\n* Verification report.\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nStructured only:\n\n* Files Modified\n* Files Added\n* Integration Flow Summary\n* Test Commands Executed + Results\n* Coverage Delta (if available)\n* --- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\n* Final Status\n\nNo narrative commentary.\n\nEnd.",
      "objective": "Complete Phase R2 by making the realism pipeline authoritative in the execution-critical runtime flow, eliminating partial/analytics-only invocation and ensuring that executed trades are deterministically processed through a single realism boundary before persistence and reporting.",
