e to PerformanceEngine.\n- Remove duplicate arithmetic.\n- Preserve legacy behavior only inside explicit gate OFF block.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nPHASE 3 \u2014 EXECUTION-LAYER AUTHORITY CHECK\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nTrace runtime execution chain:\n\nOrder placement \u2192\nExecution event \u2192\nTrade persistence \u2192\nAnalytics/store \u2192\nReporting\n\nConfirm:\n\n- PerformanceEngine is invoked before persistence.\n- Persisted trade record contains computed realism fields.\n- Analytics layer reads, not recomputes.\n\nIf analytics recomputes:\n- Remove recomputation.\n- Replace with persisted field reference.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nPHASE 4 \u2014 STRUCTURAL REGRESSION TESTS\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAdd tests asserting:\n\n1. No duplicate PnL computation\n   - Mock PerformanceEngine.process_trade\n   - Assert called exactly once per execution.\n\n2. No legacy arithmetic path\n   - Patch legacy helper if exists\n   - Assert never called when gate ON.\n\n3. Trade persistence uses computed values\n   - Compare persisted values to PerformanceEngine output.\n\n4. Gate OFF path remains deterministic.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nPHASE 5 \u2014 FAIL-FAST SAFETY\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAdd optional debug assertion (only active in dev mode):\n\nIf ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE == true and\na module attempts to compute PnL directly:\n    raise RuntimeError(\"Unauthorized PnL computation path\")\n\nThis may be implemented via:\n- Centralized PnL setter\n- Controlled property assignment\n- Internal runtime guard\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nVERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\nREQ cannot be marked DONE unless:\n\n- Full repo PnL audit completed.\n- No parallel arithmetic paths remain active.\n- Regression tests pass.\n- Gate OFF path verified.\n- Invariant enforcement present.\n- Coverage for modified modules does not decrease.\n\nOutput must include:\n\nFiles Modified\nFiles Added\nPnL Audit Report Summary\nExecution Flow Validation\nTest Commands Executed + Results\nCoverage Delta (if available)\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\nObjectives Addressed\nQuality Checks\nInvariant Enforcement Confirmed\nOutstanding Risks\nFinal Status\n\nNo narrative commentary.\nEnd.",
