      "outputs": "Files Modified\n- agents/analytics_agent.py\n- config.py\n- tests/test_analytics_agent_trade_capture.py\n\nFiles Added\n- None\n\nPnL Audit Report Summary\n- Authoritative\n  - `server/domain/performance.py::PerformanceEngine.process_trade`\n  - Runtime path use: YES\n  - Guarded by `ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE`: YES (invocation guarded in `agents/analytics_agent.py`)\n  - Classification: Authoritative\n- Legacy fallback (analytics/reporting only; not execution-trade compute path)\n  - `analytics/metrics.py::compute_trade_outcomes`\n  - `analytics/metrics.py::compute_round_trip_trades`\n  - Runtime execution path use: NO (used for analytics summaries/reports)\n  - Guarded by `ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE`: N/A\n  - Classification: Legacy fallback\n- Supporting components (not standalone PnL source)\n  - `server/domain/cost_basis.py::compute_realized_gain`\n  - `server/domain/tax.py::estimate_tax/calculate`\n  - Runtime path use: YES (inside `PerformanceEngine`)\n  - Guarded by `ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE`: Indirect via PerformanceEngine invocation\n  - Classification: Authoritative dependencies\n- Risk identified and hardened\n  - `PerformanceEngine` supports compatibility read of pre-populated `gross_pnl`.\n  - Added fail-fast guard at analytics execution boundary to reject unauthorized precomputed PnL inputs when debug guard is enabled.\n\nExecution Flow Validation\n- Confirmed flow (gate ON):\n  - Order placement (`agents/execution_agent.py`) -> `OrderExecuted` event\n  - `AnalyticsAgent._handle_order_executed` invokes `PerformanceEngine.process_trade` once\n  - Trade record populated from engine output (`gross_pnl`, `net_pnl`, `after_tax_pnl`, `realized_gain`, `tax_estimate`, `settlement_date`, `fee_breakdown`, `fees_total`)\n  - Trade persisted by store\n- Confirmed flow (gate OFF):\n  - Legacy trade capture path preserved\n  - `realism_pipeline_enabled=false`\n  - No realism output fields injected\n- Analytics recomputation check:\n  - Added regression test patching analytics metrics helpers to raise if called; execution-trade path remains unaffected.\n\nTest Commands Executed + Results\n- `.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_analytics_agent_trade_capture.py tests/test_analytics_store.py tests/domain`\n- Result: `57 passed in 7.97s`\n\nCoverage Delta (if available)\n- Not available in this environment (pytest-cov options unsupported by current pytest setup); no delta computed.\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\nObjectives Addressed\n- Full repo PnL source audit completed: YES\n- Single authoritative runtime realism boundary enforcement (gate ON): YES\n- Gate OFF deterministic behavior verified: YES\n- Structural regression tests added for duplicate-path prevention and legacy helper non-invocation: YES\n- Optional fail-fast safety implemented: YES (`REALISM_FAIL_FAST_PNL_GUARD` + runtime guard)\n\nQuality Checks\n- No execution-engine architectural redesign.\n- `ENABLE_REALISM_PIPELINE` gate preserved.\n- Legacy field compatibility retained in gate OFF path.\n- Error handling preserved via `realism_processing_error` on non-fail-fast errors.\n\nInvariant Enforcement Confirmed\n- Invariant enforced at analytics execution boundary:\n  - when gate ON, realism outputs are sourced from `PerformanceEngine.process_trade`\n  - optional debug fail-fast rejects unauthorized external PnL input path.\n\nOutstanding Risks\n- Coverage delta unavailable due environment tooling limits.\n- Guard is boundary-level (analytics execution path), not a global language-level mutation lock.\n\nFinal Status\n- DONE",
