      "request_text": "se_agent>\n\nREQ ENTRY\nID: REQ-SQLITE-COMMSCRIBE-ENGINE\nDATE: 2026-02-17\nTITLE: Replace communicate.md with SQLite-backed Communication Engine\nOBJECTIVE:\nImplement a deterministic SQLite-based replacement for the file-based communicate.md system, enforcing structured REQ lifecycle management, verification gating, and audit integrity while preserving backward compatibility and markdown export capability.\nSTATUS: IN_PROGRESS\nARTIFACTS:\n- commscribe/db/schema.sql\n- commscribe/db/migrate_from_md.py\n- commscribe/engine/communicate_db.py\n- commscribe/engine/state_machine.py\n- commscribe/cli/communicate.py\n- commscribe/scripts/communicate_scan.py (updated)\n- commscribe/tests/test_sqlite_engine.py\n- commscribe/docs/SQLITE_ENGINE_MIGRATION_REPORT.md\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n1. Create SQLite database:\n   Path: commscribe/db/communicate.db\n\n2. Define schema with tables:\n   - requests (id, title, objective, status, created_at, updated_at, archived_flag)\n   - status_history (request_id, previous_status, new_status, timestamp)\n   - verification_blocks (request_id, objectives_addressed, quality_checks, risks, final_status)\n   - artifacts (request_id, file_path, change_type)\n   - logs (request_id, log_entry, timestamp)\n\n3. Implement deterministic state machine:\n   Allowed transitions:\n     INPUT_PAD \u2192 IN_PROGRESS\n     IN_PROGRESS \u2192 DONE\n     IN_PROGRESS \u2192 BLOCKED\n     BLOCKED \u2192 IN_PROGRESS\n   Disallow direct INPUT_PAD \u2192 DONE.\n\n4. Enforce:\n   - DONE requires verification_blocks row.\n   - Reject completion if missing.\n\n5. Implement CLI commands:\n   - communicate create\n   - communicate update\n   - communicate complete\n   - communicate status\n   - communicate export-md\n\n6. Implement migration script:\n   - Parse existing communicate.md\n   - Populate SQLite tables\n   - Preserve REQ IDs\n   - Output migration integrity report\n\n7. Update communicate_scan:\n   - Operate on SQLite\n   - Validate state machine\n   - Validate verification presence\n\n8. Add tests:\n   - Lifecycle transition tests\n   - Verification enforcement test\n   - Migration integrity test\n   - Export-to-markdown equivalence test\n\n9. Ensure:\n   - No data loss\n   - Deterministic ordering\n   - Single-writer safe\n   - No silent status mutation\n\n10. Output required completion format:\n\nFiles Modified\nFiles Added\nSchema Summary\nMigration Summary\nTest Commands Executed + Results\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\nObjectives Addressed\nQuality Checks\nSchema Integrity Confirmed\nMigration Integrity Confirmed\nOutstanding Risks\nFinal Status\n\nEND REQ",
