omplete --objectives-addressed ...`\n  - `python3 commscribe/cli/communicate.py ... status --id REQ-SMOKE-1`\n  - `python3 commscribe/cli/communicate.py ... export-md --output /tmp/commscribe_sqlite_smoke.md`\n  - Result: request reached `DONE`, export markdown generated with expected REQ block.\n\n--- VERIFICATION REPORT ---\nObjectives Addressed\n- SQLite-backed deterministic communication engine implemented.\n- Structured lifecycle enforcement implemented.\n- Verification-gated completion implemented.\n- Backward-compatible markdown export implemented.\n- Migration path from existing MD/JSON implemented.\n\nQuality Checks\n- Deterministic ordering for status/export operations.\n- Explicit transition validation (no silent mutation).\n- Single-writer-safe DB operations via `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`.\n\nSchema Integrity Confirmed\n- Required tables created and accessible.\n- Foreign-key relationships enforced.\n\nMigration Integrity Confirmed\n- REQ IDs preserved during migration.\n- Migration report generated and populated.\n\nOutstanding Risks\n- Legacy `communicate_scan.py` lifecycle remains present for backward compatibility; SQLite commands were added as non-breaking integration path rather than fully removing legacy flow in this slice.\n\nFinal Status\n- DONE",
