ATION REQUIRED:\n- Confirm SQLite DB file path.\n- Confirm REQ table schema present.\n- Confirm insertion logic executed.\n- Confirm communicate.md no longer receives REQ entries.\n- Confirm no schema changes occurred.\n\nINFERENCE POLICY:\n- Do not assume SQLite is authoritative without verifying write-path.\n- If dual-write logic exists, explicitly identify it.\n- If configuration flag controls routing, explicitly identify value.\n- If DB not properly initialized, implement minimal required setup.\n\nSTATUS:\nPENDING\n\nARTIFACTS:\n- Root cause report (concise)\n- Confirmation of routing correction\n- Evidence of SQLite insertion\n- Confirmation that communicate.md is no longer authoritative",
